# Triaging an Okta Alert

Every detection in this kit routes through **Alert - Okta - Alert Router**, so this
one playbook covers all of them. The alert name you received is the name of the
scheduled search that produced it, and its description says exactly which Okta event
types it keys on and why they matter.

***

